# `<svc>` · State Machine

> 仅当本服务核心实体有**显式状态机**时填写。

## 实体

`<Entity>`

## 状态

```mermaid
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Draft
    Draft --> Submitted: submit
    Submitted --> Approved: approve
    Submitted --> Rejected: reject
    Approved --> [*]
    Rejected --> [*]
```

## 转移规则

| From | Event | To | 守卫条件 | 副作用 |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| Draft | submit | Submitted | 所有必填字段非空 | publish `<...>.submitted.v1` |
| Submitted | approve | Approved | 调用方有 approver 角色 | publish `<...>.approved.v1` |

## 终态

- `Approved` / `Rejected`：终态，不可再转
